107
00:08:29,420 --> 00:08:31,940
Let's look at this loop again.

108
00:08:31,940 --> 00:08:38,940
We want to enter the loop only if i is not equal to j, so we must branch to the end if

109
00:08:38,940 --> 00:08:40,540
