00:12:45,420 --> 00:12:47,420
This one required some work.

156
00:12:47,420 --> 00:12:53,900
After loading the value from memory to T0, the SLT is one if it's less than zero, which

157
00:12:53,900 --> 00:12:57,740
means the inverse is greater than or equal to zero.

158
00:12:57,740 --> 00:13:02,700
Next we set T3 if our value is less than 4096.

